          "description": "Activities the generator proposes inside the proposed grid's cells (docs/generator.md): subject sessions sized from the Focus-1 hours, one daily activity per practice, one per meal at its slot (titled with the ForkKnife menu's dish; the menu's prep and cook tasks arrive as tasks, not proposals). Absent on files derived before the activities half shipped; the app regenerates them live.",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
